            <div xml:id="d363">

                <pb facs="0281" n="231" xml:id="pg231"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.77/374</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Reinsch</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-04-29T09:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 29, 1918,
                                9 a.m.</hi></date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received April 29, 8.17 a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>[From Stevens:]</p>
                <p>Your cable 23d. I have given your orders to Emerson. He will go immediately to Vologda.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Reinsch</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
